OL,3,CAdam Ramsay-Peaty's estranged mum
OL,4,Cstill 'supporting from afar'
OL,6,FThe mother of Adam Ramsay-Peaty has
OL,7,Finsisted she continues to support her
OL,8,Fson "from afar" after he appeared to
OL,9,Fblame his underwhelming Commonwealth
OL,10,FGames campaign on their ongoing family
OL,11,Ffeud.
OL,13,FThe three-time Olympic champion had to
OL,14,Fsettle for his second bronze medal of
OL,15,Fthe Games in Glasgow in Monday's 50
OL,16,Fmetres breaststroke final.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
