OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1785251911
OL,3,CAdam Ramsay-Peaty's estranged mum
OL,4,Cstill 'supporting from afar'
OL,6,F"We continue to support Adam from
OL,7,Fafar. He's our son who we love, whom
OL,8,Fwe supported to reach his aspirations.
OL,9,FOur love, our time, our sacrifices
OL,10,Fwere given freely with no expectation
OL,11,Fof financial reward just genuinely
OL,12,Fgiven with the love as any mother and
OL,13,Ffather would do for their child," she
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FShe continued: "We are strong, we love
OL,17,Fand are always there for each other.
OL,18,FThe very nature of our strength as a
OL,19,Ffamily has helped us move past the
OL,20,Fnastiness, the lies that have been
OL,21,Ftold about us."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1785251911
OL,3,CAdam Ramsay-Peaty's estranged mum
OL,4,Cstill 'supporting from afar'
OL,6,FRamsay-Peaty, who is one of the most
OL,7,Fdecorated swimmers in British history,
OL,8,Fwas in noticeably higher spirits after
OL,9,Fhis second bronze on Monday, hinting
OL,10,Fthat his priorities had changed as he
OL,11,Fprepares to become a father for a
OL,12,Fsecond time.
OL,14,F"I think for me that period of time
OL,15,Fwhen I was undefeated for eight years,
OL,16,Fit was athlete first, then human. Now
OL,17,Fit's human first, then athlete, which
OL,18,Fis a very fair price to pay," he said
OL,19,Fafter the race, in which his pregnant
OL,20,Fwife Holly, 26, was watching from the
OL,21,Fstands.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1785251911
OL,3,CAdam Ramsay-Peaty's estranged mum
OL,4,Cstill 'supporting from afar'
OL,6,F"Super power looks very different now.
OL,7,FJuggling babies with milk and having a
OL,8,Ftoddler around is a different super
OL,9,Fpower.
OL,11,F"I've still got that mentality ` we
OL,12,Fjust have to approach it very
OL,13,Fdifferently. I've been that person who
OL,14,Fwins all the time and it costs you
OL,15,Fpretty much everything and I wouldn't
OL,16,Fsay it's worth it now."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOU
